      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Visitors can explore Yakama history through dioramas, Plateau artwork, and the world’s largest Strongheart collection at the local museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
